  "question": "Across Shanghai Library's first-party annual open-data surfaces, is 中国近代报纸数字文献全库 continuously listed through the current competition surface, and can persistence of the CNBKSY API document prove current competitionSearch coverage of 1951 newspapers?",
  "answer": "No continuous listing can be demonstrated. The database is explicitly listed in the 2020, 2021 and 2022 first-party open-data pages, but is not listed in 2023, 2024, 2025 or the current 2026 page. This omission is only a listing-scope observation and does not prove database nonexistence. The CNBKSY API documentation continues to be source-emitted, but the 2024 PDF, the PDF linked by the 2025 page and the current 2026 PDF are byte-identical, so documentation persistence cannot prove annual dataset-scope continuity. Current competitionSearch coverage of 1951 newspaper data therefore remains unresolved; no key or target query is used.",
